<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Overview of User Interface - Plumbfix</title>
<style>
@page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 1in;
}
body {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    font-size: 12pt;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #000000;
}
h1 {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    font-size: 16pt;
    color: #000000;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
h2 {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    font-size: 13pt;
    color: #000000;
    margin-top: 18pt;
    margin-bottom: 8pt;
    font-weight: bold;
}
